(b) the general principle of good faith in the trader’s field of activity;
“ship” includes any boat and any other description of vessel used in navigation;
“trader” means any person who in relation to a commercial practice is acting for purposes
relating to his business, and anyone acting in the name of or on behalf of a trader;
